<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Hope this message finds you well! </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">I’m reaching out to introduce you to Intel's brand-new enterprise software portfolio, created to accelerate innovation for our customers by delivering more trust from the cloud to the edge, more sustainable and affordable cloud computing, and more ROI from AI.&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Intel’s new SaaS portfolio is made up of three product suites:</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<ol>
	<li style="margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Trust &amp; Security: </span></span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Keep your data and workloads safe and compliant, from the cloud to the edge</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">AI: </span></span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Unlock more ROI with a simpler way to build, deploy, and manage AI models on any infrastructure</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Performance:</span></span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> Boost application efficiency with real-time cloud optimization for the data center</span></span></span></span></span><br />
	&nbsp;</li>
</ol>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Check out the attached one-pager for a deeper look, or to pass along to another innovation stakeholder. Regardless, let’s get something on the calendar so I can walk you through our new portfolio, or just the product suites that speak to your organization’s specific challenges. Simply reply to this email to get started.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Sincerely</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
{{{Sender.Name}}}<br />
<br />
{{{Sender.Phone}}}<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</body>
</html>